schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-zone
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art — NOT a character portrait but an ENVIRONMENT PORTRAIT of the
    Twilight Zone itself, the liminal boundary between the material world and the Plane of
    Echoes, rendered as if it were a living entity. The composition shows the boundary as a
    vast vertical tear in reality — a rift that stretches from the bottom of the frame to
    the top, its edges not clean but dissolving, material reality on the left side bleeding
    into the Echo-side on the right. On the material side: muted browns and grays, a normal
    if decayed cityscape. On the Echo side: deep indigo and amber, impossible architecture,
    shadows that move against light sources. The rift itself is the visual focus — a membrane
    between worlds that is alive, breathing, its edges constantly shifting. At the center of
    the rift, a shape almost-but-not-quite suggests a face or a hand or a doorway, never
    resolving into anything identifiable. The ground at the base of the rift is ground zero —
    cobblestones dissolving into shadow, lampposts bending toward the rift as if pulled by
    gravity. The sky above is split: normal overcast on one side, swirling amber-void on the
    other. Painterly style, massive atmospheric scale, the Twilight Zone as a character that
    dominates everything around it. The mood is existential wrongness — a wound in reality
    that has learned to breathe.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, simple portal, generic rift, person standing in frame, colorful palette, low detail, flat shading, symmetrical, geometric clean lines"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    anatomy: {weight: 3, description: "Correct human/creature proportions, no extra limbs or malformed features"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key details from prompt present — clothing, expression, distinguishing features"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, atmospheric lighting, appropriate color palette"}
    composition: {weight: 1, description: "Portrait framing, subject clearly readable, no cropping issues"}
  reject_if:
    - "extra fingers or limbs"
    - "anime or cartoon style"
    - "bright cheerful palette"

tags: [character, environment, twilight-zone, boundary, concept-art, dark-fantasy, liminal, world-portrait]
